OL,4,BRinderknech denies refusing doping test
OL,5,GFrench tennis player Arthur            
OL,6,GRinderknech says he expects to be      
OL,7,Gexonerated over allegations he refused 
OL,8,Ga doping test.                         
OL,10,FThe International Tennis Integrity     
OL,11,FAgency (ITIA) confirmed the world      
OL,12,Fnumber 57 is under investigation,      
OL,13,Fafter a report by L'Equipe earlier on  
OL,14,FWednesday.                             
OL,16,FIt relates to a "surprise" test in     
OL,17,FJune, with French newspaper L'Equipe   
OL,18,Fclaiming there was a "possible         
OL,19,Fmisunderstanding with the sample       
OL,20,Fcollector".                            
